      "why": "Full pipelining gives 1 result/cycle, which is required to absorb the 32-request burst within the 0.44us window (needs ~32 cycles at 74MHz). n_iter 12-20 and data_width 14-18 target the 2^-12 error bound with minimal area; frac_guard/angle_guard sweep the accuracy/area trade-off."
    },
